  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 7
  storyText: "Scrolling through social media today was a mistake. Bad news everywhere
    \u2014 cities falling, supply lines cut, people saying goodbye. Nothing official.
    Just panic wearing a text font. We're still holed up in our room, listening to
    the hallway like it's a living thing. Wondering when someone will come. If someone
    will come. The army said they'd find a solution. That was days ago. Funny thing
    \u2014 I used to complain about deadlines. Ten deadlines at once and I'd lose
    my mind. Now? Give me all ten. Give me finals. Give me group projects with the
    worst teammates imaginable. I'd do them all, back to back, just to trade this
    silence for a due date.\r\n\n"
